      "path": "src/ui/screens/ReviewView.tsx",
      "content": "Handle a failed Trade read after a walked-to-owed transition. The preceding `apply` already removes the ReviewCard (including its receipt and local refresh-error state). If `getTrade` then rejects or returns a non-ready result, this return leaves the owed card expanded with undefined detail, and the unmounted RecordExit cannot display the failure or offer Refresh Review again. Preserve the receipt until the read succeeds, or expose an error and retry on the replacement card.",
