      "category": "bug",
      "severity": "medium"
    },
    {
      "path": "src/ui/screens/ReviewCard.tsx",
      "content": "This focus recovery only works while the refreshed Trade remains a walked card. The newly supported Empty/removed-Trade and ReflectionsOwed results unmount ReviewCard, so `onRefreshed` updates an unmounted component and the focused receipt button disappears without a replacement focus target (especially when this card was opened automatically and `reveal` is zero). Handle refresh focus at the surviving ReviewView level, targeting the replacement owed header or a review heading when the card disappears.",
